pull_request.body:
## Goal

Make the existing automatic independent-review consumer reuse the already accepted generic Delegation lifecycle and `chatgpt-temporary` transport without widening Temporary Chat into a general CAP task mode.

Stage Research: `project-context/AUTOMATIC_REVIEWER_DELEGATION_REENTRY.md` -> **NARROW**.

## Selected path

```text
launch_independent_review_v1
 -> exact reviewer identity/state
 -> preflight installed reviewer runtime
 -> deterministic generic Delegation
 -> durable reviewer dispatch-attempted
 -> one reviewer-owned background worker
 -> authenticated chatgpt-temporary controller
 -> one non-personalized fresh Temporary Chat reviewer
 -> WORKER_RESULT_V1
 -> reviewer-specific REVIEW_RESULT_V1 validation
 -> existing automatic reviewer result state
```

`reconcile_independent_review_result_v1` may settle an already-recorded generic worker result into reviewer state, but cannot create launch or Send authority.

## Boundaries

- no seventh public tool;
- no generic dispatcher;
- no arbitrary URL/prompt/command/provider/backend/path input;
- no Transport Supervisor expansion;
- no scheduler/event bus;
- no persistent ChatGPT session;
- no automatic relaunch after reviewer dispatch is committed;
- `chatgpt-temporary` is used only by the reviewer consumer;
- ordinary CAP tasks remain ordinary ChatGPT;
- manual review fallback and existing exact PR/BASE/HEAD semantics remain.

## Installed runtime

The verified manager bundle now includes the accepted generic Delegation / Temporary controller and extension assets plus the reviewer-specific one-shot worker. Production auto-review requires the existing installed-main receipt and refuses unsafe updater states.

## Failure posture

- runtime unavailable before dispatch -> ABSTAIN, dispatch remains prepared;
- failure after dispatch -> no relaunch, reviewer remains pending/manual fallback;
- generic ABSTAIN/ERROR -> does not close reviewer result;
- generic COMPLETED payload must pass existing automatic REVIEW_RESULT_V1 validation;
- manual fallback that commits first remains authoritative.

## Acceptance status

Hosted CI is required first. Target-Windows physical E2E remains pending and must prove one neutral preflight, one Send, no plugin/app markers, exact review result settlement and no duplicate launch/Send on failure.

This PR cannot use its own new automatic-review mechanism as the mandatory adopting review before merge; a fresh ordinary-Chat manual exact-head review remains required.
